{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S05等短停留段落中，未标注到时出现的感受词仍较密集，部分意象如“我与你的亲密关系”“多年后走进旧房子”略显跳脱，容易分散注意力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"平\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的核心优势是话语重点有明显视觉锚点，观众不必逐字读完就能抓住每段关系变化；感受又能随音乐具体位置出现，把心理变化与声音、节奏、身体感受联系起来，尤其在S02、S04、S09、S13中，细微的情绪转折比X更容易被感知。两版的故事因果其实都交代得不错，但Y的前后呼应、音乐细节和情绪层次更丰富，整体更像一段逐渐展开的真实心理经历，而不只是对人物心情的概括。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "acfe1da2-1862-45ab-bccc-a6beb224ea58", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T062112693292Z", "elapsed_seconds": 107.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:22:59.712870+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0a511c3e0e213fa275ecaf589ba7d471c3a6692f03018be6b12807b6bd467e1e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat